  "tools": "Air fryer, knife, steel bowl, small bowl, tongs",
  "serves": 2,
  "cover": "cover",
  "ingredients": [
   {
    "q": "~3 medium (500 g)",
    "n": "Potatoes",
    "tag": "potato",
    "img": "i-potato"
   },
   {
    "q": "a bowl, ~4 cups",
    "n": "Ice and cold water, for soaking",
    "tag": "ice",
    "img": "i-ice"
   },
   {
    "q": "~1.5 tbsp",
    "n": "Olive oil",
    "tag": "oil",
    "img": "i-oil"
   },
   {
    "q": "~1 tsp",
    "n": "Paprika",
    "tag": "paprika",
    "img": "i-paprika",
    "alt": [
     "red-chilli-powder"
    ]
   },
   {
    "q": "~1/2 tsp",
    "n": "Red chilli powder",
    "tag": "red-chilli-powder",
    "img": "i-chilli"
   },
   {
    "q": "~1/2 tsp",
    "n": "Garlic powder",
    "tag": "garlic-powder",
    "img": "i-garlic"
   },
   {
    "q": "~1 tsp",
    "n": "Dried oregano or parsley",
    "tag": "oregano",
    "img": "i-herb"
   },
   {
    "q": "~1/2 tsp",
    "n": "Salt",
    "tag": "salt",
    "img": "i-salt"
   },
   {
    "q": "~2 tbsp",
    "n": "Grated cheese, to top",
    "tag": "cheese",
    "img": "i-cheese",
    "opt": true
   }
  ],
  "steps": [
   {
    "t": "Cut the potatoes into thick wedges.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-cut-1",
     "s-cut-2"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Put the wedges in a bowl of ice-cold water.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-ice-1",
     "s-ice-2",
     "s-ice-3"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Drain them and tip them into a steel bowl.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-drain-1"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Pat the wedges dry with a paper towel.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-dry-1",
     "s-dry-2"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Drizzle the oil over the wedges.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-oil-1",
     "s-oil-2"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Mix paprika, chilli powder, garlic powder, dried herbs and salt in a small bowl.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-mix-1"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Sprinkle the spice mix over the wedges.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-spice-1",
     "s-spice-2"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Toss with your hands until every wedge is coated.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-toss-1",
     "s-toss-2",
     "s-toss-3"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Lay the wedges in the air fryer basket in one layer.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-lay-1",
     "s-lay-2"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Air fry until golden and crisp.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-fry-1",
     "s-fry-2"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Tip the hot wedges onto a plate.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-tip-1",
     "s-tip-2",
     "s-tip-3"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "Sprinkle grated cheese and dried herbs on top. Eat hot.",
    "imgs": [
     "s-top-1",
     "s-top-2",
     "s-top-3"
    ]
   }
  ],
  "tags": [
   "air-fryer",
   "quick"
  ],
  "notes": "Silent video with only a title card: all quantities are my estimates. Air fryer temperature and time are NOT shown (wedges look golden after one batch, around 200 C for 20 to 25 minutes is a normal guess, check as they cook). The spice piles are read from colour: paprika, red chilli, garlic powder, dried herb, salt. The cheese on top looks like parmesan, which is not always vegetarian: use any cheese or skip it. Minutes does not count the soak."
